  "translation": "We set out from home and went to the supermarket with my friend. There were many people in the supermarket; we pushed a shopping cart. We first bought some fruit. We looked at apples and bananas, hesitating whether to buy apples or bananas. Finally we bought several apples and bananas. Then we went to the vegetable section and bought cabbage and tomatoes. We shopped for half an hour. At the checkout counter, we met a classmate. That classmate was also shopping. We chatted for a while. We didn't buy too many things, only paid fifty kuai. Then we happily left the supermarket. We felt that today was very pleasant."
